# Next.js App Router

- Default to Server Components. Add `'use client'` only when the file uses state, effects, or browser APIs.
- Do not import Pages Router APIs (`next/router`, `next/head`, `getServerSideProps`).
- Interactive todo UI lives in `app/components/todo-app.tsx`. Domain logic stays in `lib/todos.ts`.
- Keep persistence in `lib/storage.ts` (localStorage). Do not introduce a database here.

```tsx
// BAD — client boundary on a page that only composes UI
"use client";
export default function Page() {
  return <TodoApp />;
}

// GOOD — server page, client island
import { TodoApp } from "./components/todo-app";
export default function Page() {
  return <TodoApp />;
}
```
